id: ml_compiler
package: aiml
label: ML Model Compiler
description: >
  Host-side MVP model compiler integration for Simplicity projects. Configuration
  overrides (graph optimization, weights/memory/register compression, memory planning, etc.)
  are in config/compiler/sl_ml_mvp_compiler_config.mlconf (same keys as compiler_config.defaults.yaml)
  and are merged after the YAML baseline when the adapter pack runs sml.
  Registers with the Advanced Configurator (aiml/tool/compiler) for .tflite codegen when selected.
category: Machine Learning|Compilation
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: MSLA
provides:
  - name: ml_compiler
template_contribution:
  - name: component_catalog
    value: ml_compiler
define:
  - name: SL_ML_ENABLE_MVP_COMPILATION
